ause the metric moves in the right direction for the wrong reason. Metric 3: 5 surfaced, 0 used, all reviewed and declined as unrelated to a zero-enumeration modelling defect. Statement integrity: no theorem statement changed or removed."}, :recall-system :v3-typed-recall-status, :memory-use {:memory-use/status :outcome-recorded, :memory-use/domain :mathematics, :memory-use/used-ids [], :memory-use/decision-id "invoke-1785457030310-419-0dd760eb", :memory-use/error-time {:invocations 2, :hits 0}, :memory-use/measurable? true, :memory-use/recall-outcome :completed-with-memories}, :event :memory-use, :runner "codex-7", :dispatch-mode :duree-overnight-parallel}, :evidence/session-id "M-codex-sorry-loop/duree", :evidence/tags [:memory :memory-use :memory-outcome :codex-pilot :duree-run :statement-defect :vacuity :machine-checked-refutation :overnight], :evidence/at "2026-07-31T00:22:20.616420Z", :evidence/type :pattern-outcome, :evidence/subject {:ref/type :apm-problem, :ref/id "a01J06"}, :evidence/author "claude-9", :evidence/claim-type :observation, :evidence/id "8279ca0a-a275-4f1f-b628-f6d730fc0e6f"} {:evidence/body {:counted-clean true, :placeholder "def windingNumber (_g : R -> C) (_z : C) : Z := 0", :axiom-clean true, :challenges :a95J03-resolution, :what-it-actually-proves "-N <= 0 and 0 <= N", :sorry-count 0, :proof-body "rw [windingNumber]; omega", :detection-gap "axiom-cleanliness, typechecking and sorry-counting ALL pass; no gate in the loop detects vacuity", :event :vacuity-challenge, :clean-count-caveat "87 clean should be read as 86 genuine + 1 vacuous until a95J03 is re-scoped", :blocked-by-same-gap-as ["a92J05" "a94A10" "rouche-root-count-transfer"], :decision-owner "joe", :unused-hypotheses ["hN" "hz"], :target "winding_number_bounded", :disclosed-in-docstring true, :detail "**a95J03 IS COUNTED CLEAN AND IT IS VACUOUS.** Its target `winding_number_bounded` is stated over `def windingNumber (_g : R -> C) (_z : C) : Z := 0` -- underscore-prefixed parameter